; ＠ト書き▼議論11-3口頭弁論
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM継続：yUki
@SetCustomVariable Expression:Judge11_3_3flag=false
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_48_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge11-3-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:刚才你们问，<br>【我的裁决<br>是否有正当性】<br>……对吧。|#0206Trial03_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:关于这点<br>我也解释一下吧。|#0206Trial03_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:实际上我们魔女<br>是被人类残忍地<br>驱逐出了<br>这个世界。|#0206Trial03_Yuki003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"那是<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_01\">单方面</link>的屠杀。<br>爱好和平的我们，<br>几乎没能进行<br>像样的反击……|#0206Trial03_Yuki004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:由于人类的暴行，<br>导致我们魔女<br>从这个世界上<br>消失了。|#0206Trial03_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……那么，<br>我<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_02\">反过来灭绝</link>人类<br>又有什么问题呢？<br>|#0206Trial03_Yuki006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这既是<br>具有正当性的复仇……|#0206Trial03_Yuki007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:也意味着<br>魔女和人类，<br>平等拥有着<br>相同的权利。|#0206Trial03_Yuki008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"——那就是<br>【<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_03\">灭绝</link>其他种族】的<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_04\">权利</link>。|#0206Trial03_Yuki009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; IF 11-3-3通過で解放
@BeginIf Expression:Judge11_3_3flag=false
    @GotoModified Path:.Judge11-3-1Skip

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所谓魔女因子，<br>原本就是我自身……<br>无论我身在何处，<br>都能操纵<br>魔女因子。|#0206Trial03_Yuki010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"因此我会让魔女因子失控，<br>令全人类变作架空的怪物——<br>【<link=\"Objection_02_06_03_05\">魔女</link>】，<br>再将人类杀死。|#0206Trial03_Yuki011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ENDIF ここまで
# Judge11-3-1Skip

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不过话说回来，<br>【平等的权利】……<br>真是个好词。|#0206Trial03_Yuki012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不但可以<br>随心所欲使用……<br>还体现出了人类的本质，<br>一个简单粗暴的词语。|#0206Trial03_Yuki013| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


